  "title": "Persistent Memory Disaggregation for Cloud-Native Relational Databases",
  "abstract": "The recent emergence of commodity persistent memory (PM) hardware has altered the landscape of the storage hierarchy. It brings multi-fold benefits to database systems, with its large capacity, low latency, byte addressability, and persistence. However, PM has not been incorporated into the popular disaggregated architecture of cloud-native databases.",
